e Apollo 11 moon landing failed. The old \"X\" was dusted off and reactivated to ensure the world could see the moon walk. In 1990, just to see if it still worked, engineers turned it back on for its 25th anniversary. It still functioned!\nThe name X wasn't just a clever nickname. The official name was Intelsat I, but the Communications Satellite Corporation (COMSAT) wanted something that sounded friendly and \"pioneering.\" They chose the name from the proverb \"The X catches the worm\" to signify that they were the first to commercialize space. Id X.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T18:17:33Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Luna", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T18:17:41Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Redbird", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T18:17:42Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Early Bird", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T18:17:45Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Early bird", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T18:17:47Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "intelsat 1", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T18:17:55Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Early bird is correct", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T18:17:57Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Neeche se padhna tha", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T18:18:17Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "1965 Launch of Early Bird, the first commercial communications satellite to be placed in geosynchronous orbit.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T18:18:19Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "QOTD is getting trickier day by day 😂", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T18:18:36Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "oh just read that this in the question — oops", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T18:18:36Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Pavan 49 Srijan 36 KP 25 Sal 15", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T18:18:42Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": ",but the late worm escapes should be the entire proverb", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T18:18:54Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Last question", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]